      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having this available as a shader variable would be even better, as it would avoid the need for animator overhead. The existing variables (https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/vrc-graphics/vrchat-shader-globals/) are insufficient as we can’t distinguish between a world camera and the first person desktop view.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
